      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HELLO ELSA (8) boasts a strong record this journey with four wins and two minors from eight tries. Placed last time (30.08) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing third and beaten 2.5 lengths. Rates a leading player. HARA'S OTIS (1) is a consistent type who is lining up for his first start here. Jumped quickly and was in the firing line throughout when winning last time over 457m at Q Lakeside (25.47). Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. ZEPHYR (2) is rarely out of the finish, recording 49 places from 105 starts. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing third (30.25) at this track. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. Expected to be in the finish again. ZIPPING KIMELI (5) recorded a 2.25 lengths win (25.47) in a Grade 4/5 last time at Q Lakeside. Already a winner from this draw.",
